    "flags": "The CALL instruction does not change EFLAGS.",
    "general_registers": "ESP changes as stated. EAX, ECX, EDX, EBX, EBP, ESI and EDI are unchanged by this CALL instruction on entry to the target.",
    "next_instruction_address": "00CC8D44",
    "normal_instruction_transfer": "Let T be ESP immediately before CC8D3F. On completion of the CALL instruction and transfer to its target, ESP=T-4 modulo 2^32, [SS:T-4]=00CC8D44, and EIP=00BF6FF5 in the unchanged code segment.",
    "operand_arithmetic": "(00CC8D44 + (-859471)) modulo 2^32 = 00BF6FF5",
